PAGES = {
"brand-identity": {
 "id": "6ae317284689182a226401e9",
 "schema": ("Branding Agency", "Brand strategy and visual identity design"),
 "sections": [
  ("A brand people remember for the right reasons", [
   "Most businesses do not have a logo problem. They have a clarity problem. When nobody inside the company can say in one sentence why a customer should choose you, no amount of design will fix it. Good branding starts with that sentence, and everything else is built to say it consistently.",
   "As a branding agency in London and Dubai, we work with founders, marketing teams and growing companies who need a brand that makes sense quickly, to very different audiences, and still holds together as the business grows."]),
  ("How we build your brand identity", [
   "We start with brand strategy: your market, your competitors, your audience and the position you can credibly own. From there we shape the name, the story and the tone of voice, then design the visual identity: logo and wordmark, type, colour palette, imagery and iconography.",
   "Every part is designed as one system, so it works on a website, a pitch deck, a social post, packaging and a building. You receive brand guidelines, master files and templates, so your team can use the brand properly without calling us for every new piece."]),
  ("Rebranding without losing what works", [
   "Not every company needs to start again. Many need a brand refresh: keep what people already recognise, fix what is holding you back, and bring everything up to the standard of where the business is heading. A brand audit shows which is which. When a full rebrand is the right call, we plan the launch with you, so customers, staff and partners all see the change at the same time."])],
 "faq": [
  ("What does a branding agency do?", "A branding agency defines what your business stands for and turns it into a recognisable identity: strategy, name, messaging, logo, visual system and guidelines that keep it consistent everywhere."),
  ("How much does branding cost?", "It depends on the scope. A logo alone costs far less than full strategy, identity and guidelines. We agree a quote up front after a discovery call."),
  ("How long does a branding project take?", "A full identity usually takes a few weeks, covering strategy, design and guidelines. Feedback rounds and the size of your team affect the timeline, and we agree dates at the start."),
  ("What is the difference between a logo and a brand?", "A logo is one mark. A brand is what people think and feel about you, shaped by your positioning, name, voice, visuals and how you behave."),
  ("Do you also design brand guidelines?", "Yes. Every identity comes with guidelines that explain how to use the logo, type, colour and tone of voice, plus the master files your team needs.")]},
"web-design-development": {
 "id": "6ae332b5b56dc5d88cca8636",
 "schema": ("Web Design Agency", "Website design and development"),
 "sections": [
  ("Websites that do a job, not just look good", [
   "Your website is often the first real conversation a buyer has with you, and it usually happens before they ever contact you. If it is slow, unclear or hard to update, it quietly costs you enquiries every day. A good website makes the next step obvious and loads fast on any phone.",
   "As a web design agency in London and Dubai, we design and build websites, landing pages and web apps that are clear, quick and easy for your own team to manage."]),
  ("How we design and build your website", [
   "We start with what the site needs to achieve and who it is for, then map the pages and journeys before any visual design. UX and UI design come next: wireframes, prototypes and a design system that matches your brand, with motion and interactions where they help rather than distract.",
   "Most of our sites are built in Webflow, which gives you a fast, secure site and a CMS your team can edit without a developer. Where a project needs more, we build headless and custom integrations with your CRM, booking or payment tools."]),
  ("Built for search, speed and conversion", [
   "Every build includes the foundations that are easy to skip: Core Web Vitals, technical SEO, schema markup, accessible forms and GA4 conversion tracking. If you are redesigning, we plan the site migration and redirects so you keep the rankings you have already earned. After launch we can look after hosting, maintenance and ongoing improvements."])],
 "faq": [
  ("How much does a website cost?", "It depends on the number of pages, the design work and any integrations. A focused landing page costs far less than a full site with a CMS. We agree a quote up front."),
  ("How long does it take to build a website?", "A small site can take a few weeks; larger sites with custom features take longer. We agree the timeline at the start and share progress as we go."),
  ("Why do you build in Webflow?", "Webflow gives you fast hosting, strong security and a visual CMS, so your team can update pages and publish content without a developer."),
  ("Will my new website be good for SEO?", "Yes. We build in technical SEO, page speed, schema markup and clean structure from the start, and plan redirects when replacing an old site."),
  ("Can you redesign my existing website?", "Yes. We review what works today, keep the content and rankings worth keeping, and rebuild the rest around clearer journeys and faster pages.")]},
"seo-google-ads": {
 "id": "6ae3a51bdafdfb80fd74c145",
 "schema": ("SEO & Google Ads Agency", "Search engine optimisation and Google Ads management"),
 "sections": [
  ("Be found by people who are already looking", [
   "Search is where buyers tell you exactly what they want. SEO earns you a place in the organic results over time; Google Ads puts you at the top today. Run together, they cover the whole search page and share what they learn: the terms that convert in ads show where to invest in content, and organic rankings bring down what you pay for clicks.",
   "As an SEO and Google Ads agency in London and Dubai, we run both, so you get one plan and one set of numbers instead of two suppliers pulling in different directions."]),
  ("How our SEO works", [
   "We begin with an SEO audit and keyword research, then fix the technical problems that hold a site back: crawling, indexing, site speed, Core Web Vitals and schema markup. On-page SEO and a content strategy follow, built around the searches your buyers actually make, including local SEO and Google Maps for businesses that serve an area.",
   "Link building and digital PR then grow your authority, so the pages that matter can rank for competitive terms."]),
  ("How we manage Google Ads", [
   "Every account starts with conversion tracking in Tag Manager and GA4, including calls and form leads, so Google optimises for real enquiries rather than cheap clicks. We then build Search, Performance Max, Shopping, YouTube and remarketing campaigns, write the ad copy and improve the landing pages. Each week we review search terms, bids and lead quality, and you see the same dashboards we do."])],
 "faq": [
  ("Should I invest in SEO or Google Ads?", "Usually both. Google Ads brings enquiries quickly while SEO builds rankings that keep paying off. We set the balance based on your budget and how fast you need results."),
  ("How long does SEO take to work?", "Technical fixes can help within weeks, but most sites see meaningful ranking gains over several months. It depends on competition and where your site starts."),
  ("How much does SEO and PPC management cost?", "Ad spend goes directly to Google. Our fee is agreed up front based on the size of the account and the SEO work involved."),
  ("Do you offer local SEO?", "Yes. We optimise your Google Business Profile, location pages and local citations so you appear in Maps and local results."),
  ("Will I own my Google Ads account and data?", "Yes. Your account, analytics and campaign history stay yours, and you have full access at all times.")]},
"social-media-content": {
 "id": "6ae3a51b9cd510666842c896",
 "schema": ("Social Media Agency", "Social media management and content production"),
 "sections": [
  ("Social media that builds an audience, not just a feed", [
   "Posting every day is easy. Posting things people stop scrolling for is the hard part. Most brands do not need more content; they need a clear point of view, a recognisable format and the consistency to keep showing up with it.",
   "As a social media agency in London and Dubai, we plan, produce and run social content for brands that want an audience they can sell to, not just a follower count."]),
  ("How we plan and produce your content", [
   "We start with social strategy: who you are talking to, which platforms they use and what you want to be known for. That becomes a content calendar of repeatable formats across Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn and YouTube Shorts.",
   "Our team handles content production end to end: short-form video, Reels and Stories, photography, motion graphics, carousels, copywriting and captions. We manage your accounts day to day, including community management and moderation, so comments and messages get a reply."]),
  ("Paid social and partnerships", [
   "Organic content builds trust; paid social puts it in front of the right people. We run Meta, TikTok and LinkedIn ads, including lead gen ads, using the content that already performs best. Influencer outreach and UGC content add voices beyond your own. Social listening, analytics and monthly reporting show what is working, so the next month's plan is based on evidence."])],
 "faq": [
  ("What does a social media agency do?", "A social media agency plans your strategy, creates content, manages your accounts and community, runs paid social campaigns and reports on what is working."),
  ("Which social media platforms should my business use?", "The ones your buyers actually use. For many B2B brands that is LinkedIn; for consumer brands it is often Instagram and TikTok. We recommend a focus during strategy."),
  ("How much does social media management cost?", "It depends on the platforms, how much content you need and whether paid social is included. We agree a monthly scope and fee up front."),
  ("Do you create video content?", "Yes. Short-form video is at the centre of most of our content plans, from planning and filming to editing, motion graphics and captions."),
  ("Do you run paid social ads?", "Yes. We run Meta, TikTok and LinkedIn ads, and ad spend goes directly to the platforms.")]},
"commercial-print-production": {
 "id": "6ae3a51c3781d291b2383bc1",
 "schema": ("Commercial Printing", "Print management and commercial print production"),
 "sections": [
  ("Print that matches the standard of your brand", [
   "A brochure, a business card or an exhibition stand is often the most physical contact someone has with your brand. When the colour is off, the paper feels thin or the finish is wrong, people notice, even if they cannot say why. Print should feel as considered as everything you do online.",
   "We handle commercial printing and print management for brands in London and Dubai, from a single run of business cards to packaging, signage and full exhibition builds."]),
  ("From artwork to delivery", [
   "We design or prepare the artwork, run pre-press checks and colour proofs, then source the right print partner for each job, whether that is litho, digital or large format. You get one point of contact for print production, and we manage quotes, timelines and quality checks so the finished piece arrives as approved.",
   "Paper and finishes make a real difference, so we advise on stock, foiling, embossing and other finishes that suit the budget and the brand."]),
  ("What we produce", [
   "Brochure printing, catalogues, leaflets and flyers. Business cards, stationery printing and letterheads. Packaging printing and label printing. Large format print, banners, signage, window graphics, vinyl graphics and wall wraps. Exhibition stands, pop-up displays, point of sale and shelf displays. Branded merchandise, corporate gifts, branded apparel and gift packs."])],
 "faq": [
  ("What is print management?", "Print management means one partner handles your print from artwork to delivery: preparing files, choosing the right printer, checking proofs and managing quality and deadlines."),
  ("Can you design the artwork as well as print it?", "Yes. We can design from scratch, adapt your existing artwork or prepare supplied files so they are print-ready."),
  ("How much does commercial printing cost?", "It depends on quantity, size, paper and finishes. We give you a clear quote for each job before anything goes to print."),
  ("Do you produce exhibition stands?", "Yes. We design and produce exhibition stands, pop-up displays and the printed collateral that goes with them."),
  ("Will I see a proof before printing?", "Yes. You approve a proof before every job goes to print, and colour proofs are available where colour accuracy matters.")]},
}
